{'symbol': 'DE', 'date': '2021-10-14 01:19:00', 'title': 'DEERE REMAINS COMMITTED TO REACHING NEW UAW AGREEMENT', 'text': 'MOLINE, ILL., OCT. 14, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE INTERNATIONAL UNION, UNITED AUTOMOBILE, AEROSPACE AND AGRICULTURAL IMPLEMENT WORKERS OF AMERICA (UAW) HAS CALLED A STRIKE AGAINST DEERE & COMPANY (NYSE: DE), AFFECTING MORE THAN 10,000 WORKERS AT 14 FACILITIES ACROSS THE UNITED STATES.'}